WEBVTT

NOTE
Accessibility audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2 (Game Disc 3)
Scene: disc02_04h.avi - Squall exits into space
Duration: approximately 7 seconds
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Squall propels himself through the darkness of space in his white spacesuit, his body controlled and purposeful. Thrusters on his suit fire, creating brief bursts of blue or white light as he accelerates toward Rinoa. His silhouette is distinct against the starfield, moving with urgency and precision toward the distant figure of the drifting sorceress. The vast scale of space surrounds him, yet his motion is direct and unwavering. This is a critical moment of action and bravery — a rescue mission in the most hostile environment imaginable.
